#
# PLACEHOLDERS. These teams do not exist yet and no person is assigned to any role as
# of 2026-09-15. GitHub silently ignores an unknown team in CODEOWNERS, so this file
# is inert until the teams are created — which is the correct failure mode for a
# single-contributor repository, but it means nobody should read a green pull request
# as evidence that the named owner looked at it. Create the teams, then assign people
# to the roles in docs/DOC-OWNERSHIP.md and here in the same change.
#
# Last matching rule wins, so the file runs general to specific.

